<title>FRANCE: Gehe says 97 profit between 450-500 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Gehe says 97 profit between 450-500 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German drugs wholesaler Gehe AG said on Monday it expected pre-tax operating profit this year to be between 450 and 500 million marks after 407 million marks in 1996.</p>
<p>At a news conference held in Paris, Gehe AG also said it expected sales to rise to about 24 billion marks, up from 21.42 billion marks in 1996.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
